OL,3,GNEWSAFree film screening to explore
OL,4,Aclimate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FA free screening of a film which
OL,7,Foutlines the impact of climate change
OL,8,Fboth now and in the future will be
OL,9,Fhosted by Hull City Council.
OL,11,FThe National Emergency Briefing,
OL,12,Fpresented by naturalist Chris Packham,
OL,13,Fwill be played at Hull's Guildhall on
OL,14,F24 November followed by a discussion
OL,15,Fled by council leader Mike Ross and
OL,16,Fcabinet member for the environment
OL,17,FCharles Quinn.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
