OL,3,GNEWSAFree film screening to explore
OL,4,Aclimate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the event would help
OL,7,Fpeople to learn more from experts and
OL,8,Funderstand how the council was
OL,9,F"responding to the climate and nature
OL,10,Femergency".
OL,12,FQuinn said: "Hull is susceptible to the
OL,13,Fimpacts of climate change more than
OL,14,Fmost so it is important the council and
OL,15,Fthe city realises the urgency with
OL,16,Fwhich we need to act."
